<title>BELGIUM: Russia should join EU, Chernomyrdin says.</title>
<headline>Russia should join EU, Chernomyrdin says.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia should join the EU in the near future, Russian Prime Minister Viktor Chernomyrdin said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;In the near future, I think that Russia should be in the EU with all the implications and consequences, not all of which will be easy for us,&quot; Chernomyrdin told a news conference in reply to a question after meeting European Commission President Jacques Santer.</p>
</text>
